## \uc0\u55357 \u56522  Data Specifications\
\
### Current Grid Resolution\
- **Latitude:** 44\'b0N to 56\'b0N (33 points, ~0.375\'b0 spacing)\
- **Longitude:** 2\'b0E to 17\'b0E (41 points, ~0.375\'b0 spacing)\
- **Total grid points:** 1,353 per timestep\
- **Temporal resolution:** Hourly (24 hours/day)\
\
### Variables\
| Variable | Name | Unit | Data Points (ocean only) |\
|----------|------|------|--------------------------|\
| `swh` | Wave Height | m | ~6,456/day (ocean only) |\
| `t2m` | Temperature | \'b0C | ~32,472/day (all points) |\
| `tp` | Precipitation | mm | ~32,472/day (all points) |\
| `sst` | Sea Surface Temp | \'b0C | ~4,320/day (ocean only) |\
| `wind_speed` | Wind Speed | m/s | ~32,472/day (all points) |\
\
### File Sizes\
- **NetCDF:** ~20 MB/day\
- **GeoJSON:** ~5 MB/day (all 5 variables)\
- **Total 28 days:** ~140 GeoJSON files, ~140 MB\
